hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1369","Ahmed bin Mansour Al-Ramadi and Muhammad bin Yahya told us, saying: Hajjaj bin Muhammad told us, he said: Ibn Jurayj said: He informed me. Ya`la, who is Ibn Muslim, on the authority of Sa`id ibn Jubayr, on the authority of Ibn Abbas, “If you have been harmed by rain or are sick,” Abd said. Al-Rahman bin Awf: “He was wounded”"
